OL,3,ACarney to push for closer ties at
OL,4,ACanada-EU summit in Montreal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor decades, Canada-EU summits took
OL,7,Fplace without much fanfare - but that's
OL,8,Fnot the case for this coming two-day
OL,9,Fmeeting in Montreal.
OL,11,FThursday and Friday's summit will be
OL,12,Fclosely watched for details on how
OL,13,FCanada and the European bloc deepen
OL,14,Ftheir ties.
OL,16,FLast month, European Commission
OL,17,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen proposed
OL,18,F"opening the door" to Canada for what
OL,19,Fshe called an "associate membership" -
OL,20,Fa status that does not currently exist.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
