OL,3,ACarney to push for closer ties at
OL,4,ACanada-EU summit in Montreal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe overture came after Prime Minister
OL,7,FCarney addressed the European
OL,8,FParliament in Strasbourg, telling EU
OL,9,Flawmakers that Canada and Europe were
OL,10,F"stronger together" in the face of
OL,11,F"geopolitical rupture".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
